WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.272
Pig looked at Bat.

2
00:00:16.273 --> 00:00:19.156
Cat looked at Bat.

3
00:00:19.157 --> 00:00:21.676
Cow looked at Bat.

4
00:00:21.677 --> 00:00:25.090
"The fox is coming," said Pig.

5
00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:32.849
"We have to do something!" said Cat.

6
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:36.010
"We can hide," said Bat.

7
00:00:36.011 --> 00:00:41.393
"Cow, you hide behind the henhouse.

8
00:00:41.394 --> 00:00:44.505
Pig, you hide behind the tractor.

9
00:00:44.506 --> 00:00:48.318
Cat, you hide behind the windmill."

10
00:00:48.319 --> 00:00:52.070
"Where will you go?" Cow asked Bat.

11
00:00:52.071 --> 00:01:03.114
"I will go to an apple tree," said Bat.

12
00:01:03.115 --> 00:01:07.022
"Soon the fox will be here," said Bat.

13
00:01:07.023 --> 00:01:11.926
"And we will make some noise!"

14
00:01:11.927 --> 00:01:23.955
So Cow went to the henhouse.

15
00:01:23.956 --> 00:01:28.623
Pig went to the tractor.

16
00:01:28.624 --> 00:01:33.210
Cat went to the windmill.

17
00:01:33.211 --> 00:01:41.236
Bat flew to an apple tree.

18
00:01:41.237 --> 00:01:50.099
They all waited.

19
00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:55.020
They waited for the fox to come.

